flowchart LR
    Change[Contributor or agent change] --> Guidance[Expanded written routing rules]
    Change --> Index[Git index]
    Guidance --> Manual[Contributor runs applicable tools]
    Index --> Hooks[Existing hooks]
    Hooks --> Gate[Existing deterministic gates]
    Hooks --> Push[Push]
    Push --> CI[Existing CI path filters]
    CI --> Merge[Merge]
    Manual -. no content-bound proof .-> Hooks
